  "title": "Jan's Chocolate Chip Pound Cake",
  "description": "Jan's chocolate chip pound cake recipe is irresistibly moist and rich. Its buttery, tender crumb complements the bits of chocolate chips in every bite.",
  "authors": [
    "What's for dinner, mom?"
  ],
